The first match of the S Block 
League will now begin.

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:30.490
Sir, our team made it to the 
top four of the S/J League.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:34.230
Hah. What does it matter if they win?

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:39.150
What do you think is important to a company?

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:42.900
Pursuing profit and creating an environment 
where employees' minds are at ease.

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.610
Exactly!

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:49.320
Since joining this company, I've done
 my very best to achieve that.

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:51.610
The badminton team

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:54.540
