produces no profit, and is an outrage.

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:57.960
It deserves to be shut down!

00:21:58.740 --> 00:22:01.190
Don't you agree?

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:05.560
With the semifinals of the S/J 
League coming up tomorrow,

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:08.590
we've invited the captains of the top 
four teams to come speak with us.

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:12.150
Competing alongside perennial championship 
contenders Mitsuhoshi Bank, Unisics,

00:22:12.150 --> 00:22:14.740
