two league just last year.

00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:21.900
Captain Miyazumi, a question for 
you: How do you feel right now?

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:26.310
Uh, yeah. Our current 
team is in g-great shape.

00:22:26.310 --> 00:22:27.120
