through the s-semifinals.

00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:30.200
<i>I hope we can ride this momentum 
through the s-semifinals.</i>

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:31.520
He's stuttering like crazy.

00:22:31.520 --> 00:22:32.650
