00:22:32.650 --> 00:22:34.730
Apparently, this stream is being archived.

00:22:34.730 --> 00:22:37.120
I could never do this!

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:38.580
Miyazumi-san, you've got this.

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:40.120
