because you made it into the top four!

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:47.310
We're playing Unisics in the semifinals 
tomorrow at the tournament.

00:22:47.310 --> 00:22:49.970
You two hold the key.

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:51.800
We're counting on you brothers.

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:52.680
Yes, sir!

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:55.940
P-Paving the way to the future with focus

00:22:55.930 --> 00:22:57.810
He's stuttering like crazy.

00:22:55.940 --> 00:22:58.420
<i>and shuttles is the Badaryman way.</i>

00:22:57.810 --> 00:22:59.770
Either way, they did well.

00:23:00.010 --> 00:23:02.630
Promise you'll come cheer 
the team on tomorrow.

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:03.980
